# Content honesty

- Real places live in `src/data/directory.ts` (`DogDirectoryListing`). Do not promote `src/data/listings.ts` — those names are placeholders.
- Do not invent businesses, hours, policies, ratings, or "verified" facts. `unknown` is valid; a guessed yes is not.
- Community reports are leads, never facts. Keep sources and last-verified dates attached.
- Keep Waco Wagging Approved: pending means Not Yet Evaluated — no seal, no verdict. Do not assign real verdicts without evidence. Sample listings stay labeled `isSample`.
- Public name is always "Keep Waco Wagging Approved" — never shortened. Approval cannot be bought.
- Do not put GO / CARE / KNOW / BELONG / SHOP in the visible nav. Those are jobs underneath `docs/product-map.md`.
- Prefer extending `DogDirectoryListing` and `ApprovedListing`. Do not create a third listing system.
- Existing URLs stay. Redirects in `next.config.ts` stay unless the owner asks to change them. Do not add Platinum Scoops ↔ KWW redirect maps without asking.
